            {
              "deprecatedIds": [
                "CVE-2026-97045",
                "GO-2026-6866"
              ],
              "fullDescription": {
                "markdown": "In childTextNodesAreLiteral, walking up the tree previously stopped at the nearest foreign ancestor once an HTML integration point was found. However, that integration point may itself be a descendant of an element that was foster-parented into a foreign namespace (such as \u003cmglyph\u003e or \u003cmalignmark\u003e fostered under \u003cmtext\u003e), causing a parser to resolve the subtree in a different foreign namespace upon re-parsing the rendered output.\n\nContinue walking the full ancestor chain and verify that every transition from a non-empty namespace occurs at an HTML integration point before emitting literal text.",
                "text": "In childTextNodesAreLiteral, walking up the tree previously stopped at the nearest foreign ancestor once an HTML integration point was found. However, that integration point may itself be a descendant of an element that was foster-parented into a foreign namespace (such as \u003cmglyph\u003e or \u003cmalignmark\u003e fostered under \u003cmtext\u003e), causing a parser to resolve the subtree in a different foreign namespace upon re-parsing the rendered output.\n\nContinue walking the full ancestor chain and verify that every transition from a non-empty namespace occurs at an HTML integration point before emitting literal text."
              },
